flowchart TD
  EV["Owner says sent, or worker/PM says done, or durable completion evidence appears"]
  BIND{"Can the event be bound to exact destination, lane and stable ID"}
  UNB["mark SENT_EVENT_UNBOUND / NEEDS_RECONCILIATION - do not guess"]
  TR["persist the lane transition in the same handling turn - destination, IDs, event time, evidence"]
  SUP["suppress duplicate resend or stale in-flight prompts for that destination plus stable ID"]
  INV["Delivery bounded invariant checks - INV-SENT, INV-DONE, INV-DELIVERY, INV-RENDER, INV-NOIDLE, INV-INDEPENDENT"]
  S1["1 reconcile the exact changed lane"]
  S2["2 inspect READY_SAFE_PARALLEL work"]
  S3["3 inspect fired triggers and resumption conditions"]
  S4["4 reconcile pending OWNER_ACTION packets"]
  S5["5 reconcile Delivery state"]
  S6["6 inspect capacity and dependencies relevant to newly executable work"]
  S7["7 inspect relevant project Management interfaces without violating PM authority or Deferred Sync - Chief LP"]
  S8["8 inspect pending CEO, Architect, Delivery and Chief work - Chief LP"]
  Q{"Executable work found"}
  R1["AI-role work - route or execute through the owning authority, no Owner ping"]
  R2["genuine Owner packet - render one complete packet, PASTE INTO exact chat"]
  R3["none - claim no current work only after the full sweep, never from NEEDS_OWNER_PING = 0 alone"]
  G["never wait behind unrelated DELEGATED_IN_FLIGHT lanes"]
  EV --> BIND
  BIND -->|"no"| UNB
  BIND -->|"yes"| TR
  TR --> SUP
  SUP --> INV
  INV --> S1
  S1 --> S2
  S2 --> S3
  S3 --> S4
  S4 --> S5
  S5 --> S6
  S6 --> S7
  S7 --> S8
  S8 --> Q
  Q -->|"AI-executable"| R1
  Q -->|"Owner required"| R2
  Q -->|"nothing"| R3
  R1 --> G
  R2 --> G
